        "original_id": "93b06fc9-9747-56f5-953e-d489bfce4946",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry M. Morris, John C. Whitcomb, Ronald Numbers\n- Products: The Genesis Flood\n- Concepts: young Earth creationism, Christian apologetics\n\nFacts:\n- Henry Madison Morris was born on October 6, 1918, and died on February 25, 2006.\n- Henry M. Morris was an American engineer, young Earth creationist, and Christian apologist.\n- In 1961, John C. Whitcomb and Henry M. Morris coauthored The Genesis Flood: The Biblical Record and its Scientific Implications.\n- Henry M. Morris is widely known for coauthoring The Genesis Flood.\n- Ronald Numbers wrote that The Genesis Flood elevated young Earth creationism to a position of fundamentalist orthodoxy.",
